{"version":1,"slug":"Others__Quantitative_Aptitude_-_General_Quant_-_SSC_SUPER_PRACTICE_38919_(20Q)","path":"Others/Quantitative Aptitude - General Quant - SSC SUPER PRACTICE 38919 (20Q).html","title":"devgagan","provider":"Others","category":"Quantitative Aptitude - General Quant - SSC SUPER PRACTICE 38919 (20Q).html","durationMinutes":60,"totalQuestions":20,"sectionsLocked":false,"sections":null,"questions":[{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If X<sup>4</sup> + X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>4</sup> = 432 and X<sup>2</sup>  -  XY + Y<sup>2</sup> = 18, then find the value of X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> is. </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; X<sup>4</sup> + X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>4</sup> = 432 &#2324;&#2352; X<sup>2</sup> - XY + Y<sup>2</sup> = 18, &#2340;&#2379; X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">21</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">21</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">15</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">15</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">18</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">27</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">27</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>X<sup>2</sup>  -  XY + Y<sup>2</sup> = 18 .... (i)</p><p>As we know, </p><p>(X<sup>2</sup>  -  XY + Y<sup>2</sup>) (X<sup>2</sup> + XY + Y<sup>2</sup>) = X<sup>4</sup> + X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>4</sup></p><p>18 * (X<sup>2</sup> + XY + Y<sup>2)</sup> = 432 </p><p>X<sup>2</sup> + XY + Y<sup>2</sup> = 24 .... (ii)</p><p>Add (i) and (ii)</p><p>X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> = (18 + 24)/2 = 21 </p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 256a<sup>4</sup> + 64a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup> + 16b<sup>4</sup> = 864 and 16a<sup>2</sup> + 4b<sup>2</sup>  -  8ab = 36, then what is the value o