p>3</sup> + 91Y<sup>3</sup> + 273X<sup>2</sup>Y  -  111XY<sup>2</sup> = 13AX<sup>2</sup>Y + 13BY<sup>3</sup> + 13CXY<sup>2</sup>  -  AX<sup>3</sup>  -  BY<sup>2</sup>X  -  CX<sup>2</sup>Y</p><p>Comparing the value of A, B, and C in LHS and RHS</p><p>-AX<sup>3</sup> = -37X<sup>3</sup> </p><p>A = 37 </p><p>13BY<sup>3</sup> = 91Y<sup>3</sup></p><p>B = 7 </p><p>273X<sup>2</sup>Y = 13AX<sup>2</sup>Y  -  CX<sup>2</sup>Y </p><p>273 = 13A  -  C </p><p>C = 208 </p><p>A + B  -  C = 37 + 7  -  208 = -164</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If X  -  Y = 19 and 1/X  -  1/Y = 19/36, then what is the value of X<sup>3</sup>  -  Y<sup>3</sup> + X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup>? </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; X - Y = 19 &#2324;&#2352; 1/X - 1/Y = 19/36, &#2340;&#2379; X<sup>3</sup> - Y<sup>3</sup> + X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">6103</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">6103</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">8155</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8155</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">6859</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">6859</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4807</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4807</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>1/X  -  1/Y = 19/36 </p><p>(Y  -  X)/XY = 19/36 </p><p>-19/XY = 19/36 </p><p>XY = -36 </p><p>X<sup>3</sup>  -  Y<sup>3</sup> + X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup> = (X  -  Y)<sup>3</sup> + 3XY (X  -  Y) + (XY)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 19<sup>3</sup> + 3 * -36 (19) + 36<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 6859  -  2052 + 1296 </p><p>= 6103</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 144X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> = 57 and XY = 16, Y &lt; O, then the value of 1728X<sup>3</sup> + Y<sup>3</sup> is:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 144X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> = 5